# Hand-written fixture for cube.obj.
newmtl GroundSurface
Kd 0.3 0.3 0.3

# brick's `d` and `Ns` are single fractional digits chosen (not 0.9/250) because those
# happen to parse identically under tinyobjloader's not-correctly-rounded number parser
# and strtod -- these do not, so obj_sidecars.test can actually tell the two apart.
newmtl brick
Kd 0.7 0.3 0.2
Ks 0.1 0.1 0.1
d 0.7
Ns 0.7
map_Kd brick.png

newmtl RoofSurface
Kd 0.9 0.06 0.09
